@startuml 03_alur_crud_proyek_dan_studi_kasus
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam handwritten false
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName "Segoe UI", Arial, sans-serif
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
skinparam roundCorner 8
skinparam BoxPadding 15
skinparam ParticipantPadding 15
skinparam SequenceLifeLineBorderColor #333333
skinparam SequenceLifeLineBackgroundColor #F8F9FA
skinparam ArrowColor #222222
skinparam NoteBorderColor #CCCCCC
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor #FFFFE0

title Diagram Alur REST API: Manajemen Proyek & Detail Studi Kasus

actor "Firman (Admin)" as Admin
participant "ProjectsTab.tsx\n(Tabel Proyek Admin)" as ProjectsTab
participant "CaseStudyModal.tsx\n(Modal Pratinjau)" as CaseStudyModal
participant "ProjectModal.tsx\n(Form Edit Proyek)" as ProjectModal
participant "Upload API\n(/api/upload)" as UploadAPI
participant "Express REST API\n(Port 5000 /api/projects)" as BackendAPI
database "PostgreSQL Database\n(Tabel: projects)" as DB
participant "Halaman Web Detail\n(/projects/[id]/page.tsx)" as WebDetailPage

== 1. Meninjau & Pratinjau Studi Kasus Proyek ==
Admin -> ProjectsTab: Buka menu "Proyek & Portofolio"
activate ProjectsTab
ProjectsTab -> Admin: Menampilkan tabel proyek + badge "Detail Studi Kasus (X Poin)"

Admin -> ProjectsTab: Klik tombol "Detail Studi Kasus" pada baris proyek
ProjectsTab -> CaseStudyModal: Buka modal pratinjau (props: project)
activate CaseStudyModal
CaseStudyModal -> Admin: Menampilkan Pratinjau:\n- Latar Belakang & Solusi (longDescription)\n- Kemampuan Sistem (highlights checklist)\n- Tech Stack (tags) & Key Metrics
deactivate CaseStudyModal

== 2. Mengedit Konten Proyek & Mengunggah Gambar ==
Admin -> CaseStudyModal: Klik tombol "Edit Detail Studi Kasus"
activate CaseStudyModal
CaseStudyModal -> ProjectModal: openEditCaseStudy(project)\n(Aktifkan Tab: Detail Studi Kasus)
deactivate CaseStudyModal
activate ProjectModal

opt Admin Mengganti Screenshot Proyek
    Admin -> ProjectModal: Pilih file gambar baru (PNG/JPG max 10MB)
    ProjectModal -> UploadAPI: POST /api/upload (FormData: file)
    activate UploadAPI
    UploadAPI -> UploadAPI: Validasi tipe file & upload ke Supabase Storage
    UploadAPI --> ProjectModal: Return URL publik CDN gambar
    deactivate UploadAPI
end

Admin -> ProjectModal: Ubah Latar Belakang & Solusi (longDescription)
Admin -> ProjectModal: Tambah / hapus butir Kemampuan Sistem (highlights)
ProjectModal -> ProjectModal: Live Checklist Preview ter-update otomatis
Admin -> ProjectModal: Perbarui Key Metrics & Tags teknologi
Admin -> ProjectModal: Klik tombol "Simpan Proyek"

== 3. Pengiriman REST API & Persistensi Data ==
ProjectModal -> BackendAPI: PUT /api/projects/:id/case-study\nPayload: {longDescription, highlights, metrics, tags, subtitle}
activate BackendAPI
note over BackendAPI: Sanitasi parameter:\n- Validasi array highlights & tags\n- Update timestamp updatedAt

BackendAPI -> DB: UPDATE projects SET longDescription = ..., highlights = ... WHERE id = :id
activate DB
DB --> BackendAPI: Status 200 OK\n(Row updated successfully)
deactivate DB

BackendAPI --> ProjectModal: Response JSON {success: true, message: "Detail studi kasus berhasil diperbarui."}
deactivate BackendAPI

ProjectModal --> Admin: Toast sukses & tutup modal
deactivate ProjectModal

== 4. Pengunjung Mengakses Halaman Studi Kasus di Web ==
actor "Pengunjung Web" as Visitor
Visitor -> WebDetailPage: Akses URL /projects/voluntrip (atau /projects/:uuid)
activate WebDetailPage
WebDetailPage -> DB: getProjects() -> Query tabel projects
activate DB
DB --> WebDetailPage: Return data proyek lengkap
deactivate DB

note over WebDetailPage: Resolusi ID Ganda:\n1. Coba cocokkan String(p.id) === id\n2. Coba cocokkan slug judul: title.toLowerCase().replace(/\\s+/g, '-') === id
WebDetailPage --> Visitor: Render halaman studi kasus lengkap dengan Highlights, Key Metrics, & Gambar resolusi tinggi
deactivate WebDetailPage

@enduml
